  "description": "The uncrewed Roscosmos ISS Progress 90 cargo spacecraft launched to the International Space Station from the Baikonur Cosmodrome in Kazakhstan November 21 on a Soyuz booster rocket. Progress is filled with nearly three tons of supplies and cargo and will dock to the Poisk module on November 23.   Join NASA as we go forward to the Moon and on to Mars -- discover the latest on Earth, the Solar System and beyond with a weekly update in your inbox.  Subscribe at: https://www.nasa.gov/subscribe",
